{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_04_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8c852ad5b715e968397e3392be279c407436f21b2824ef2487fd959b49b620e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4873828a2fec64395a7956e762c9694ae1c913686d2e29d898baef23f92c5d13",
      "text": "……有个感觉有点吓人、\n让人搞不懂的前辈在啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42fcd17ce7f3b6273670f3e536300c875ecf4cae7ffe46e9766e5d1b7a03b258",
      "text": "倒也不是被对方做了什么就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ae3d0a314baf9229c0353b7e9f1ed1289272056582d045400bf240c37557be",
      "text": "（……难道说，是我做了什么吗？\n在不知不觉中伤到了对方，所以被拉开距离了也说不定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a455e11e7692ee738311c78f282a510917f1dd4c019d011b6400156331e23cf7",
      "text": "（……没错，在那家伙的时候也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfc38d52dc0ca8fe3722752ee733bfc27d3bb5c23a2aa23935af67d3528b4fc",
      "text": "…………\n啊——，真是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e967bc8225ed88bc4ffab075e92ccb99a5bc5d9b24eeb74b1d0d60d8fd81bbe",
      "text": "哎呀，突然怎么了。别大喊大叫的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a4e680e9092eec3772c6de63a64c2fdab1b79050628e9d35a91c2cbf8dcceb6",
      "text": "对、对不起。没什么。\n我要再盛一碗，把那个盘子递给我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0765f55cb22793dc437bbf0dea8e60e1a51c1bf3ae46fc6fb27aa77b517342aa",
      "text": "（……我这个大笨蛋！\n为了无法挽回的事意志消沉，又能顶什么用啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ffa750a1b8137e388be75eded43501f05563540e588b330f45514ab09d7c11c",
      "text": "（与其磨磨蹭蹭地后悔，不如向前看。\n把自己的脑子和时间资源，拿去为了未来而使用啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1482abe446a636970b5c6652b256399739f10389b76bcfbfa773c3d11d70f2f",
      "text": "（天峰秀，这次一定要拯救那家伙对吧？\n通过制作人给我的，名为偶像的这条新道路）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da4aa635b69882c064d49a934473207cfc8728b98af65e7e3296461b67ccfb6",
      "text": "（身为天才，可别做无用功啊！笨蛋！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
